     covering (model 405) and so reads as bald. All six are skin on skin. They are
     counted and named by
     BodySlotLintTest.theSkinBaseOnANonGarmentSlotIsUpstreamsAloneAndIsNamed, so the
     figure cannot grow in silence.

     Two of ours were left as they are and are disclosed rather than fixed. "Tobias"
